| | | Friend — I’m reaching out personally because this campaign means a lot to me. I know what it’s like to work multiple jobs and still worry about making rent. I know what it feels like to be one unexpected bill away from falling behind. _That’s not a story I read about. It’s a life I’ve lived. And it’s why I’m running for Congress._ Because too many people in Washington (Democrats included...) have no idea what that feels like, and it shows in the decisions they make or the money they take. **I’m running to fight for working people. To take on corporate greed. To pass Medicare for All. To tax the rich.** **To make sure families don’t have to struggle the way mine did just to get by.** **[Will you join this movement with a contribution today?](https://click.actionnetwork.org/ss/c/u001.iIBo0N5fSFzEFL40Tn-vtbMETCUYClkOrOh9-SNJfqsFlYb8tSgv_iNH9eUO8IibbLOfX6PT-3gGyMq8W09rTWGkhpOgx1v3_y0wksFDKhC57umKjg75i7zm7NBFpOE9lWw97IYC8yPYy0Kk-UeyQi8kYtPLtV6LYtIE7v0wNmDbl0g8vA1VLc7BjmH9LplnfX1mJS-Vj0FgqEf5OZO9qHEbwsayl8M8LFKxEV0uOntqkAP9AEyw5DWDI95xxyjeFVMjXWBuYrWLMCr6jAdVvl9u3YLJOo0SolqU25Z0MBKgwUQI-SaKSf_tRyoyUH8YuhRVi9PGNHCCDcTgbI-dG8SaHcuK0WVc8wuzXmWpCGI/4qf/eS24Ctu4T0au0mlQl-FSrQ/h0/h001.Rv1S3JgoDg5uIJmu7gl8iaXMFDhvrhHHfxAB2I93Dy4)** _If you've saved your payment information with ActBlue Express, your donation will go through immediately._ [Donate $10
